        "variant": "General QAOA for DGMVP with binary block encoding and hard qubit-excitation mixer",
        "ansatz": "Alternating cost operator U(C,γ) and hard mixing operator M_L(β), primarily M_1(β)",
        "optimizer": "DA (Dual Annealing) and COBYLA",
