        "encoding_method": "block_encoding",
        "encoding_details": "Each asset weight w_t is encoded with l binary variables z_t^k and coefficients b_k=2^{k-1}a, with a=1/(2^l-1). The portfolio weights satisfy w_t=Σ_k b_k z_t^k.",
        "objective_function": "minimize f(w)=w^T Σ w subject to w^T 1_n=1, w_i∈[0,1], and w_i/a∈Z",
